    "title": "Standard",
    "description": "Something considered by an authority or by general consent as a basis of comparison; an approved\nmodel.\n\nIt is a technical document designed to be used as a rule, guideline, or definition. It is a consensus-built,\nrepeatable way of doing something.\n\nStandards are created by bringing together all interested parties such as manufacturers, consumers, and regulators of a particular material, product, process, or service.",
